# Backend (NestJS) — `api/`

## Module pattern

- Controller + Service + Module + Entity + DTOs (`class-validator`)
- Path aliases: `@/*`, `@auth/*`, `@users/*`, etc.
- Inject dependencies; keep business logic in services

## Domain rules

- **Single `users` table** — members are users; login via **crewcode + password** (not email)
- **RBAC**: SuperAdmin (all), Admin scoped by `ruolo` (`pilot` | `cabin_crew`), User self-service
- Serialize sensitive fields (`note`, `itud`, `rsa`) only for Admin+
- Dates: accept UI `DD/MM/YYYY`, persist `YYYY-MM-DD` in `users.service.ts`

## PDF & AI

- PDF: use `generateWithHtml()` (Puppeteer), not pdf-lib templates
- Ollama: preserve HTML when input is HTML; configure via `api/.env`

## Tests (TDD)

- Co-locate unit tests: `*.service.spec.ts` beside `*.service.ts`
- Run: `cd api && npm test` / `npm run test:watch`
- E2E: `npm run test:e2e` when adding HTTP-level behavior

## Database

- Migrations only for schema changes; run `npm run migration:run`
- Seeds: `npm run seed` (dev), `npm run seed:prod` (production checklist in `CLAUDE.md`)
